function OrganizationStudentLookup({notice}){const [form,setForm]=useState({studentName:"",studentNumber:"",institution:"",department:""}),[matches,setMatches]=useState([]),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[requested,setRequested]=useState({});async function search(e){e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setMatches([]);try{const d=await api("/organization/student-lookup",{method:"POST",body:JSON.stringify(form)});setMatches(d.matches||[]);if(!d.matches?.length)notice("No exact matching student record was found.");}catch(err){notice(err.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}async function request(certificateId){setBusy(true);try{const d=await api("/organization/access-requests",{method:"POST",body:JSON.stringify({certificateId,purpose:"Employment or academic admission verification"})});setRequested(v=>({...v,[certificateId]:true}));notice(d.message||"Graduate permission requested.");}catch(err){notice(err.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}return <section className="panel"><h3>Find a student's certificate</h3><p>Enter the student's four identifying details. Verity searches the institution-issued records and reveals the original document only after graduate approval.</p><form className="gridform" onSubmit={search}><label>Student name<input value={form.studentName} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,studentName:e.target.value})} required/></label><label>Matriculation number<input value={form.studentNumber} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,studentNumber:e.target.value})} required/></label><label>Institution<input value={form.institution} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,institution:e.target.value})} required/></label><label>Department<input value={form.department} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,department:e.target.value})} required/></label><button className="primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?"Searching…":"Search Verity records"}</button></form>{matches.map(m=><div className="rowitem" key={m.certificateId}><div><b>{m.studentName}</b><small>{m.studentNumber} · {m.institution} · {m.department}</small></div><div className="actions"><span className={"tag"+(m.status==="ACTIVE"?"":" revoked")}>{m.status}</span>{m.requestable&&<button disabled={busy||requested[m.certificateId]} onClick={()=>request(m.certificateId)}>{requested[m.certificateId]?"Request submitted":"Request graduate consent"}</button>}</div></div>)}</section>}
function AdminCertificatePreview({certificateId}){const [preview,setPreview]=useState(null),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);async function open(){setBusy(true);try{setPreview(await api("/admin/certificates/"+certificateId+"/document-preview"));}catch(e){window.alert(e.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}return <><button disabled={busy} onClick={open}>{busy?"Opening…":"Preview file"}</button>{preview&&<InlineDocumentPreview url={preview.url} mimeType={preview.mimeType} title={preview.originalName} subtitle={preview.student?.studentName+" · "+preview.student?.studentNumber+" · "+preview.student?.institution+" · "+preview.student?.department} onClose={()=>setPreview(null)}/>}</>}
function InlineDocumentPreview({url,mimeType,title,subtitle,onClose}){return <div className="overlay" onClick={onClose}><section className="panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Certificate document preview" style={{width:"min(1000px,94vw)",height:"90vh",display:"flex",flexDirection:"column",gap:12}} onClick={e=>e.stopPropagation()}><div className="panel-head"><div><h3>{title||"Certificate preview"}</h3>{subtitle&&<p>{subtitle}</p>}<small>Private in-app preview · temporary access</small></div><button type="button" onClick={onClose}>Close</button></div><div style={{flex:1,minHeight:0,overflow:"auto",background:"#f3f5f8",display:"grid",placeItems:"center"}}>{mimeType==="application/pdf"?<iframe title="Certificate PDF preview" src={url} style={{width:"100%",height:"100%",border:0,background:"#fff"}}/>:<img src={url} alt="Original certificate preview" style={{maxWidth:"100%",maxHeight:"100%",objectFit:"contain"}}/>}</div></section></div>}
